msgstr "Gestisci la fatturazione"

msgid "Manage subscription"
msgstr "Gestisci abbonamento"

msgid ""
"Many sites keep adding content after a page appears. Each page is counted"
" only once it has finished loading, so lists, tabs and sections that load"
" late are included. It takes a little longer, and the count is more "
"complete."
msgstr ""
"Molti siti continuano ad aggiungere contenuti anche dopo la pubblicazione"
