#. stopped before the end of the crawl": the reason it stopped.
msgid "the server was running out of disk space"
msgstr "il server stava esaurendo lo spazio su disco"

msgid "this crawl reached the most Markdown one crawl may save"
msgstr ""
"questa scansione ha raggiunto il numero massimo di file Markdown che una "
"scansione può salvare"

msgid "vs."
msgstr "rispetto a."

#. the caption under a project's big number, which is a count of words.
msgid "words, each page once"
msgstr "parole, ogni pagina una volta"

#. Translators: a group of pages told apart by their writing system.
#. %(script)s is a script's name in your language (Latin, Cyrillic,
#. Arabic…), as the browser names it; phrase it so any name fits.
#, python-format
msgid "written in %(script)s"
msgstr "scritto in %(script)s"

#. %(cms)s is the platform the site is built on, such as Webflow or WordPress.
#, python-format
msgid ""
"wxrks has a %(cms)s connector: it pulls your content straight from "
"%(cms)s, translates it with the best AI models and keeps it in sync."
msgstr ""
"wxrks ha un connettore %(cms)s: importa i tuoi contenuti direttamente da "
"%(cms)s, li traduce con i migliori modelli di IA e li mantiene "
"sincronizzati."

msgid ""
"wxrks pulls the content and translates it with the best AI models, then "
"keeps it in sync as the site changes."
msgstr ""
"wxrks recupera i contenuti e li traduce con i migliori modelli di IA, poi"
" li mantiene sincronizzati quando il sito cambia."

#. Translators: marks a duration as approximate ("~25 min"). %(duration)s is
#. a duration such as "25 min" or "1h 8m".
#, python-format
msgid "~%(duration)s"
msgstr "~%(duration)s"

